HolyHammer prover installations
================================

This directory may hold local, untracked prover installations, one
directory per version:

    e-<version>/<platform>/eprover-ho (or eprover)
    vampire-<version>/<platform>/vampire
    zipperposition-<version>/<platform>/zipperposition
    z3-<version>/<platform>/z3_tptp

`<platform>` is such as `arm64-linux` or `x86_64-darwin`.  The newest
version directory holding a binary wins.  A binary placed directly in this
directory is also found.  Do not commit prover binaries.

`tools/download-provers` installs the tested E, Vampire, and Zipperposition
in the same layout, in the first of: its `--dest` argument;
`$HOL4_HAMMER_DIR/provers`; this directory, if `$HOLDIR` is set and it is
writable; `$HOME/.hol4/hammer/provers`.  `../README` lists the other ways
of telling HolyHammer where a prover is.
